  "chapter": "EV_EXTREME_VOLTAGE",
  "description": "This advanced alloy, §bVoidium Touched Tungsten Steel§r, commands respect with its complex composition. You'll produce its dust by mixing §5liquid ender air§r, §32 Vanadium Steel Dust§r, §34 Tungsten Dust§r, and §34 Voidglass Shard Dust§r. Once mixed, this dust will need to be smelted into its final form.

